0..82 Comment "//! A product of two sums over free naturals has one normal form, however it sums."
83..86 Comment "//!"
87..166 Comment "//! Grégoire and Leroy normalise the product of 128 plus `x` and 128 plus `y`."
167..233 Comment "//! Its free variables leave matches stuck inside the normal form."
234..237 Comment "//!"
238..320 Comment "//! Each factor runs sixteen successors past a free variable, so the product stops"
321..404 Comment "//! on matches over `x` and `y`. The path writes both products, the right factor of"
405..433 Comment "//! one summed in two steps."
434..437 Comment "//!"
438..518 Comment "//! - cites: [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction], § 6"
519..557 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
558..561 Comment "//!"
562..735 Comment "//! [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction]: https://doi.org/10.1145/581478.581501 \"Grégoire and Leroy, A compiled implementation of strong reduction\""
